### Ticket Format Reference

```markdown
- [ ] **#T-001: [Task Title]**
  - **Role**: `implementer` (Model: `flash`)
  - **Scope**: `src/modules/...`
  - **Depends on**: `#T-000` or —
  - **Objective**: Concise description of what needs to be done.
  - **Resolution** (filled upon close): Brief summary.
  - **Verified** (filled upon close): Command re-run by Supervisor → observed result.
  - **Commit** (filled upon close): hash | **Implemented by**: role (model).
```
